// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
//  ZAFIRA TILI - Struct Metodlari (impl va self) 🔷
//  Fayl: examples/struct_methods_test.zf
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

// 1. Struct e'lon qilish
struct Odam {
    ism: String,
    yosh: Int,
    shahar: String
}

// 2. Struct metodlarini impl orqali biriktirish
impl Odam {
    // self maydonlarini o'qish
    fn salom(self) {
        return "Salom, mening ismim " + self.ism + ", yoshim " + String(self.yosh) + " da."
    }

    // self maydonini o'zgartirish va yangilangan qiymatni qaytarish
    fn yosh_oshir(self, yil: Int) {
        self.yosh = self.yosh + yil
        return self.yosh
    }

    // Shaharni o'zgartirish
    fn shahar_koch(self, yangi_shahar: String) {
        self.shahar = yangi_shahar
        return self.shahar
    }

    // Ichki metod chaqiruvi
    fn toliq_malumot(self) {
        return self.salom() + " Hozirda " + self.shahar + "da yashayman."
    }
}

// 3. Bank hisobi structi (mablag' boshqaruvi)
struct BankHisob {
    egasi: String,
    balans: Int
}

impl BankHisob {
    fn depozit(self, summa: Int) {
        self.balans = self.balans + summa
        return self.balans
    }

    fn yechish(self, summa: Int) {
        if self.balans >= summa {
            self.balans = self.balans - summa
            return self.balans
        }
        return -1
    }

    fn hisobot(self) {
        return self.egasi + " balansi: " + String(self.balans) + " UZS"
    }
}

// ─── AMALDA SINASH ───

print("=== 1. Odam structi va metodlari ===")
let jasper = Odam("Jasper", 25, "Toshkent")
print(jasper.salom())

print("\n1 yil o'tgach:")
let yangi_yosh = jasper.yosh_oshir(1)
print("Yangi yosh: " + String(yangi_yosh))
print("Obyekt maydoni tekshiruvi: " + String(jasper.yosh))

print("\nShaharni o'zgartirish:")
jasper.shahar_koch("Samarqand")
print(jasper.toliq_malumot())

print("\n=== 2. BankHisob structi va metodlari ===")
let hisob = BankHisob("Javohirbek", 100000)
print(hisob.hisobot())

print("Depozit qo'shish (50000):")
hisob.depozit(50000)
print(hisob.hisobot())

print("Pul yechish (30000):")
hisob.yechish(30000)
print(hisob.hisobot())

print("\n[Muvaffaqiyatli] Barcha struct metodlari bekamu-ko'st ishladi!")
